PART A - BUILD BITCOIN CORE

1. Open Ubuntu terminal.

2. Create project directory:
mkdir bitcoin_project

3. Move into directory:
cd bitcoin_project

4. Clone Bitcoin repository:
git clone https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin.git

5. Move into repository:
cd bitcoin

6. Install dependencies:
sudo apt update

sudo apt install build-essential git libtool autotools-dev automake pkg-config bsdmainutils python3 libevent-dev libboost-system-dev libboost-filesystem-dev libboost-test-dev libboost-thread-dev libssl-dev libzmq3-dev

7. Check repository files:
ls

8. Create build directory:
mkdir build

9. Move into build directory:
cd build

10. Configure project:
cmake ..

11. Build Bitcoin Core:
make -j4

12. Check build structure:
ls

13. Move into bin directory:
cd bin

14. Verify Bitcoin version:
./bitcoind --version


